Package: carwatch
Title: Registration-Aware Processing of CARWatch Sampling Logs and Saliva Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Robert", "Richer", email = "robert.richer@fau.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Robert Richer [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Robert Richer <robert.richer@fau.de>
Description: Reconstruct CARWatch registrations from immutable app logs,
    review conversion anomalies through an auditable two-pass workflow, and
    combine sampling-compliance information with saliva biomarkers.
